    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "naked",
      "rationale": "ערומ i ken min olgeta no gat klos, o i no gat klos bilong brethren — planti translator i tok Yeshayahu i go long hatpela klos tasol, i no olgeta naked."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Long taim dispela, Yahwe i tok long han bilong Yeshayahu, pikinini bilong Amots, i tok: Go, na yu opim ⟨i⟩ klos sak i stap long wes bilong yu, na yu pulim sanadal bilong yu i kamap long lek bilong yu. Na em i mekim olsem, i wokabaut naked na bila lek.",
